        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then all the congregation of the people of Israel departed from the presence of Moses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they came, every one whose heart stirred him, and every one whose spirit moved him, and brought the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s offering to be used for the tent of meeting, and for all its service, and for the holy garments. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So they came, both men and women; all who were of a willing heart brought brooches and earrings and signet rings and armlets, all sorts of gold objects, every man dedicating an offering of gold to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And every man with whom was found blue or purple or scarlet stuff or fine linen or goats' hair or tanned rams' skins or goatskins, brought them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Every one who could make an offering of silver or bronze brought it as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s offering; and every man with whom was found acacia wood of any use in the work, brought it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And all women who had ability spun with their hands, and brought what they had spun in blue and purple and scarlet stuff and fine twined linen; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all the women whose hearts were moved with ability spun the goats' hair. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the leaders brought onyx stones and stones to be set, for the ephod and for the breastpiece, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.35.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and spices and oil for the light, and for the anointing oil, and for the fragrant incense. ",
